# Skill Catalog

> **On-Demand**: Loaded when referenced

## How to Use Skills

```bash
# Look up whether a skill applies (no match is a successful outcome)
vibe route "<your request>"

# View a specific skill's definition
vibe skills info <skill-id>

# List all available skills
vibe skills list
```

Skill definitions are resolved by `vibe route` (`skill_file` / `NEXT STEP`)
or `vibe skills info <skill-id>` (Source file). Do not guess
`skills/<id>/SKILL.md`.

## Installing New Skill Packs

```bash
vibe install <pack-name>
vibe install https://github.com/user/skills
```

